{{define "title"}}Pricing - MPP Viewer{{end}}

{{define "main"}}
<main class="page page--text centered">
  <div class="page__head">
    <h1>Pricing</h1>
  </div>

  {{with .Flash}}<p class="flash">{{.}}</p>{{end}}

  <p class="lead">
    Opening a plan is free and always will be. What is paid for is the second party - the
    colleague who opens your schedule through a link without installing anything.
  </p>

  <div class="plans__wrap">
    <table class="plans">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th></th>
          <th>No account</th>
          <th>Free account</th>
          <th class="plans__best">Pro</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Open and read a plan</td>
          <td class="plans__yes"><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></td>
          <td class="plans__yes"><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></td>
          <td class="plans__yes plans__best"><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Export to Excel</td>
          <td class="plans__yes"><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></td>
          <td class="plans__yes"><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></td>
          <td class="plans__yes plans__best"><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Keep plans to come back to</td>
          <td class="plans__none"><span class="sr-only">-</span></td>
          <td>20 plans</td>
          <td class="plans__best">Unlimited</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Share a read-only link</td>
          <td class="plans__none"><span class="sr-only">-</span></td>
          <td>2 at a time</td>
          <td class="plans__best">Unlimited</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Put a password on a link</td>
          <td class="plans__none"><span class="sr-only">-</span></td>
          <td class="plans__none"><span class="sr-only">-</span></td>
          <td class="plans__best plans__yes"><span class="sr-only">Yes</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Upload size</td>
          <td>10 MB</td>
          <td>10 MB</td>
          <td class="plans__best">50 MB</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="plans__note">
    Revoking a link is free on any plan - making a project private again kills its link for
    everyone, immediately. Sharing needs a confirmed email address on any plan. A link sent from an unproven mailbox is
    a reputation problem, so the address is checked once before the first link goes out.
  </p>

  <section class="prose">
    <h2>Pro is free right now</h2>

    <p>
      Ask for Pro and you get it <strong>free for a month</strong>. When the month is up you renew
      it from your account with one click, free again, for as long as early access lasts. That is a
      deliberate trade: at this stage the product needs people using it and telling us what breaks
      far more than it needs the money.
    </p>

    <p>
      There is no price yet, and inventing one to fill this page would be dishonest. When Pro
      starts costing something, the amount and the billing terms will appear here and in the terms
      of use, and nobody is charged without agreeing to it first.
    </p>

    <h2>Common questions</h2>

    <dl class="faq">
      <dt>Do I have to pay to read a file someone sent me?</dt>
      <dd>No, and you do not need an account either. Drop the file, read the chart, download the spreadsheet if you want one. Nothing is stored and nothing is charged.</dd>

      <dt>What happens when early access ends?</dt>
      <dd>You will be told before anything changes, and never charged without agreeing to it. Nothing you saved is taken away and no plan stops opening - the free tier keeps working exactly as it does now.</dd>

      <dt>What happens to my plans if I stay on the free tier?</dt>
      <dd>They stay. The free tier keeps up to 20 saved plans and 2 live share links; going over the cap stops new saves, it never deletes an old one.</dd>

      <dt>What happens when my free month runs out?</dt>
      <dd>You drop back to the free tier. No plan is deleted and public links keep working, but sharing returns to 2 links at a time, saving stops above 20 plans, and <strong>any password-protected link becomes private and stops opening for the people you sent it to</strong>. Renewing is one click on the account page while early access is open.</dd>

      <dt>Is there anything to cancel?</dt>
      <dd>Not today - there is no payment and no billing cycle to end. You can delete your account from the account page at any time, which removes every plan and link with it.</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>
</main>

{{template "sitefooter" .}}
{{end}}
